{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-35","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：最小公倍数与整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers measure any number, the least number measured by them will also measure the same.","book":7,"number":35,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.35","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.35/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":35,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-35@raw-c9c679f2eff48edd","contentId":"euclid-7-35","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9c679f2eff48edd23ac88472c86995a86c87511d7cdd0d3639483b4e37799bb","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-35.statement","euclid-7-35.construction.1","euclid-7-35.proof.1","euclid-7-35.proof.2","euclid-7-35.proof.3","euclid-7-35.conclusion","euclid-7-35.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-35.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-35","revisionId":"euclid-7-35@raw-c9c679f2eff48edd","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ff32c6d4d6e8e8e3918ac72d8fcc2475e013988d7b08a91bb431d1373ac7cecb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers measure any number, the least number measured by them will also measure the same."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字整除 任何数字, 以它们整除的最低数字 也将是整除相同的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-35.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-35","revisionId":"euclid-7-35@raw-c9c679f2eff48edd","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4c0d83e779dca0dd41e39d53632dd20f56fa02962979be5690463581c948c3f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two numbers A, B measure any number CD, and let E be the least that they measure; I say that E also measures CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B,整除 任何CD,让E至少为整除;我说E也是整除,CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-35.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-35","revisionId":"euclid-7-35@raw-c9c679f2eff48edd","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a57939f5b0d083ca0c814089554238df01a5bc24141b0a5cafdeddd49c7f66c7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if E does not measure CD, let E, measuring DF, leave CF less than itself."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果E没有整除 CD,E,DF, 离开的比自己少CF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-35.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-35","revisionId":"euclid-7-35@raw-c9c679f2eff48edd","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11e597b8fc991dfca7f7db777489fd27f7959429f6b5d6ab8aaa4bec009058a2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since A, B measure E, and E measures DF, therefore A, B will also measure DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A,B,整除,E,DF,E,整除,DF,A,A,B 也整除,DF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-35.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-35","revisionId":"euclid-7-35@raw-c9c679f2eff48edd","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1acc4bda3067d4391467c616aec0e4a98a2a329c33e3935f5a20e98cd804c8e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But they also measure the whole CD; therefore they will also measure the remainder CF which is less than E: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它们也拥有整除个, 全部CD, 因此它们也将拥有整除个, 其余的CF, 不到E,这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-35.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-35","revisionId":"euclid-7-35@raw-c9c679f2eff48edd","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4a6e74c80c91691aaa13873d43500d1dcec03873f0146bed76b961c4a34a323","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E cannot fail to measure CD; therefore it measures it. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E不能不达到整除 CD;因此,它达到整除。 Q E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-35.source","contentId":"euclid-7-35","revisionId":"euclid-7-35@raw-c9c679f2eff48edd","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bdbbb2690c80101080eea676be39ea3d290e437411233d0b145b07dfdee16d36","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.35/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.35\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-36:euclid-7-35:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-36","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-36.proof.7","euclid-7-36.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-35","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.36","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org